# Flutter-Flask-Firebase Project Guidelines

## Project Context
This is a piano UI game application built with:
- Flutter (client-side) 
- Python Flask (server-side)
- Firebase (database)
- Uses MIDI files for piano gameplay
- Target platforms: Chrome (web) and Android devices

## Flutter Best Practices

### Architecture & State Management
- Implement state management using Provider/Riverpod/Bloc pattern
- Structure the project with feature-based organization
- Separate UI from business logic with clear layering
- Use repository pattern for data access
- Implement service classes for business logic
- Create models for all data structures

### UI/UX Guidelines
- Use stateless widgets when possible for better performance
- Implement responsive designs that work across all device sizes
- Follow Material Design or Cupertino design guidelines consistently
- Use themes for consistent styling
- Extract reusable widgets for common UI patterns
