### Flask Architecture
- Create a proper project structure:
  ```
  /app
    /models        # Data models
    /routes        # API endpoints
    /services      # Business logic
    /schemas       # Request/response schemas
    /utils         # Helper functions
    /config        # Configuration
    /extensions    # Flask extensions setup
