## Database Handling for Piano Game

### Firebase Database Architecture

#### Firestore Collections Design
- **Users Collection**:
  ```
  /users/{userId}
    - displayName: String
    - email: String
    - photoURL: String
    - createdAt: Timestamp
    - lastLogin: Timestamp
    - preferences: {
        difficulty: String,
        keyboardSize: Number,
        soundSettings: Object,
        visualFeedback: Boolean
      }
    - stats: {
        totalPlayTime: Number,
        songsCompleted: Number,
        averageAccuracy: Number,
        highestStreak: Number
      }
  ```

- **Songs Collection**:
  ```
  /songs/{songId}
    - title: String
    - artist: String
    - difficulty: Number (1-10)
    - category: String
    - tags: Array<String>
    - duration: Number
    - bpm: Number
    - timeSignature: String
    - keySignature: String
    - midiFileURL: String
    - coverImageURL: String
    - popularity: Number
    - featured: Boolean
    - dateAdded: Timestamp
    - versions: Array<Object>
  ```

- **UserProgress Collection**:
  ```
  /userProgress/{userId}/songs/{songId}
    - bestScore: Number
    - bestAccuracy: Number
    - playCount: Number
    - lastPlayed: Timestamp
    - completedAt: Timestamp
    - difficulty: String
    - notes: {
        perfect: Number,
        good: Number,
        missed: Number
      }
    - milestones: Array<Object>
    - practiceSegments: Array<Object>
  ```

- **Leaderboards Collection**:
  ```
  /leaderboards/{songId}/scores/{entryId}
    - userId: String
    - displayName: String
    - score: Number
    - accuracy: Number
    - date: Timestamp
    - difficulty: String
    - perfectNotes: Number
    - combo: Number
  ```

- **Challenges Collection**:
  ```
  /challenges/{challengeId}
    - title: String
    - description: String
    - startDate: Timestamp
    - endDate: Timestamp
    - songs: Array<String>
    - requirements: Object
    - rewards: Object
    - participants: Array<String>
  ```

#### Database Indexing Strategy
- Create compound indexes for frequently queried fields
- Index songs by difficulty, category, and popularity
- Index user progress by completion status and scores
- Index leaderboards by score for efficient ranking
- Create indexes for date-based queries
- Implement pagination-friendly index structures

#### Database Security Rules
- Implement field-level security for user data
- Restrict leaderboard writes with score validation
- Validate song data updates with admin authentication
- Implement rate limiting for leaderboard updates
- Create validation rules for user progress updates
